## COMPRESSION CONFIG (CompressConfig)

Key parameters to control compression behavior:

| Parameter | Default | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|---------|
| `compress_user_messages` | `False` | Skip user messages (preserve intent) |
| `compress_system_messages` | `True` | Compress system prompts |
| `protect_recent` | `4` | Don't touch last N messages (active context) |
| `protect_analysis_context` | `True` | Detect analyze/review intent â†’ no compress |
| `target_ratio` | `0.3` | Target compressed size (0.3 = 70% saved) |
| `min_tokens` | `100` | Skip compression if content too small |

