## IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST

When building `context_compression` module:
- [ ] `detect_content_type(text)` â€” heuristic detector (no ML deps)
- [ ] `compress_json(data, target_ratio)` â€” SmartCrusher  
- [ ] `compress_code(code, lang)` â€” signature extractor
- [ ] `compress_logs(logs, keep_critical=True)` â€” log deduplicator
- [ ] `compress_text(text, target_ratio)` â€” TF-IDF summarizer (no model)
- [ ] `compress_messages(messages, config)` â€” full pipeline
- [ ] `CompressionResult` dataclass â€” with `tokens_before`, `tokens_after`, `ratio`
- [ ] `CCRStore` â€” simple dict-based reversible store (no DB needed)

