## TOKEN ESTIMATION (no tiktoken needed)

```python
def estimate_tokens(text: str) -> int:
    # Rule of thumb: ~4 chars per token for English
    # ~2.5 chars per token for code (more tokens per char)
    if is_code(text):
        return len(text) // 2
    return len(text) // 4
```

